v 3
d connectedness. VAR-type, TVP-VAR and DCC-GARCH connectedness measures
d
d Estimates the connectedness measures of Diebold and Yilmaz (2009, 2012) from static
d and rolling-window VARs, quantile and LAD VARs, (adaptive) LASSO, ridge and
d elastic-net VARs and the TVP-VAR connectedness measures of Antonakakis,
d Chatziantoniou and Gabauer (2020), with corrected total, pairwise and influence
d indices, row or scalar normalization, frequency connectedness (Barunik and Krehlik
d 2018), joint and extended joint connectedness, R2 decomposed and model-free
d connectedness, DCC-GARCH volatility connectedness (Gabauer 2020) and its R2
d decomposition, asymmetric (positive and negative) connectedness and the spillover
d asymmetry measure, group measures (aggregated, conditional, inclusive, exclusive,
d internal, external), network plots, and portfolio and hedging strategies (minimum
d connectedness, multivariate hedging, risk-parity, bivariate portfolios, hedge
d ratios). Port of the ConnectednessApproach R package by David Gabauer (GPL-3).
d Includes 18 datasets from published applications.
d
d Requires: Stata 16.1 or newer
d Author: Nikolaos Antonakakis, University of Nicosia
d Support: antonakakis.n@unic.ac.cy
d Distribution-Date: 20261024
d License: GPL-3
